questions.stem:
Consider the following code segment.

```text
IF (age < 28)
{
   price ← 5
}
ELSE
{
   IF (member)
   {
      price ← 8
   }
   ELSE
   {
      IF (age ≥ 54)
      {
         price ← 7
      }
      ELSE
      {
         price ← 12
      }
   }
}
DISPLAY (price)
```

What is displayed when age is 9 and member is true?

The following code segment is intended to display the number of elements in `nums` that are greater than 18.

```text
count ← 0
FOR EACH n IN nums
{
   IF (n ≥ 18)
   {
      count ← count + 1
   }
}
DISPLAY (count)
```

When `nums` is `[2, 18, 11, 21, 24]`, the code displays 3 instead of 2. Which change corrects the error?

